Spoken prompts
==============

internal/prompts/voices holds speech made with the text-to-speech models
below, encoded as AMBE+2 and Codec2 vocoder frames. hack/prompts makes them
again.

kitten-mini-bruno, kitten-mini-hugo, kitten-mini-luna
  Model: KittenTTS mini 0.8 (KittenML/kitten-tts-mini-0.8), voices Bruno,
  Hugo and Luna.
  License of the model: Apache License 2.0.
  Source: https://huggingface.co/KittenML/kitten-tts-mini-0.8 and
  https://github.com/KittenML/KittenTTS
  The authors do not state the training data of the model.

kokoro-bm-lewis
  Model: Kokoro-82M v1.0 (hexgrad/Kokoro-82M, revision
  f3ff3571791e39611d31c381e3a41a3af07b4987), voice bm_lewis.
  License of the model: Apache License 2.0.
  Source: https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M
  The model card states that the training data holds public domain audio,
  audio under permissive licenses, CC BY audio (Koniwa, CC BY 3.0; SIWIS,
  CC BY 4.0) and synthetic audio from closed text-to-speech services.
